<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean feed millers seek 52,500 tonnes of corn.</title>
<headline>S.Korean feed millers seek 52,500 tonnes of corn.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyers group, known as the Top Margin Committee, has invited tenders to buy 52,500 tonnes of corn by 5:00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Thursday, traders said.</p>
